Package: LearnerRegrQuantregForest
Type: Package
Title: Quantile Regression Forests for 'mlr3'
Version: 2026.22.11
Author: person("Jules", "Ponssard", email = "julesponssard@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Jules Ponssard <julesponssard@gmail.com>
Description: Provides a regression learner that connects 'quantregForest'
    to 'mlr3'. The learner exposes the number of trees as a hyperparameter
    and returns conditional mean predictions. It can be used in resampling
    and benchmarks alongside other regression learners.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    mlr3,
    paradox,
    quantregForest,
    R6,
    stats
Suggests:
    testthat
